WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
I wanted to ask you the last time we met

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,560
It's because you were distracted and didn't hear Shen Wan

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,440
Have you been to Nanyang Lake?

4
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:06,880
I keep having a recurring dream

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,200
In my dream, there was a girl standing by Nanyang Lake with her back to me.

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,440
Tell about what happened after the natural disaster

7
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:11,480
Later we separated

8
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,800
I died on a mission

9
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,460
Never saw her again

10
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,460
Until the last shootout

11
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:18,260
It was only when you turned to leave that I noticed your back

12
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:21,630
Exactly like the person in the dream, the girl in the dream later

13
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:22,790
Gradually reveal his face

14
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:24,110
Eighty-nine points similar to you

15
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,590
It turns out she was not reborn

16
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:27,390
But I dreamed about what happened in my previous life

17
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:29,270
No wonder she has always been so special to me

18
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:30,790
Then when you dream about your own death

19
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:32,590
Is the natural disaster over?

20
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:33,990
After the cold weather, there is still extreme heat

21
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:36,820
I don’t know what happens after that.

22
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:39,580
This dream was after the heavy rain that started three or four months ago

23
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,420
I exchanged all my savings for supplies.

24
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,420
I didn’t expect the disaster in my dream

25
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,780
It really happened

26
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,460
At least you made the right choice
